今日もなんだかやる気が起きないなんて
Even today, feeling somehow unmotivated,

548
00:49:51,700 --> 00:49:55,460
甘え尽くしの自分が本当は嫌いで
I really hate this self that pampers and indulges itself.

549
00:49:56,740 --> 00:49:59,572
とりあえずは外で深呼吸 更新
For now, take a deep breath outside and refresh.

550
00:50:02,396 --> 00:50:04,226
カッコつけてるつもりで得意になって
Acting cool and getting full of yourself,

551
00:50:04,226 --> 00:50:06,096
大事なものは全部置き去りにしちゃって Transformation!
leaving everything important behind. Transformation!

552
