弱気になってどうする
What's the use of getting timid?

553
00:50:09,056 --> 00:50:11,836
明日の君はどうする
What are you going to do tomorrow?

554
00:50:11,836 --> 00:50:13,996
黙って下向いてちゃ聞こえない
If you just stay silent and look down, you won't hear a thing.

555
00:50:16,516 --> 00:50:21,016
男なら 誰かのために強くなれ
If you're a man, be strong for someone's sake!

556
00:50:21,016 --> 00:50:25,616
ぶつかり合って 精一杯やってみろ
Clash against it and give it your absolute all!

557
